{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>For by the mouth of these words</b> — and adjacent is \"and he was there with YHWH forty days,\" to teach that on account of oral matters (דברים שבעל פה) he lingered there forty days: \"For by the mouth of these words I have made a covenant with you.\" These are the oral matters. Thus in Ecclesiastes: \"and written up truthfully\" (וכתוב יושר דברי אמת) — ס\"ת. \"Covenant,\" and adjacent to it: \"words of the sages.\"" "<b>the mouth of these words I have made a covenant with you</b> — ס\"ת in gematria: HaTalmud."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:05.719758375Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}